# D3-MI-001: Hydrated and anhydrous magnesium sulfate: compare formula units, not grams
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 40mL
add v1 epsomite 0.005mol
add v2 water 40mL
add v2 MgSO4 0.005mol
measure v1 balance
measure v2 balance
measure v1 conductivity
measure v2 conductivity
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
